  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Mirror lake he sits as Ma tribe alliance leader in the main tent while Ma tribe faces Song tribe’s battle lines, and he sends Cheng Hu then Fei Sheng out to raise morale.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mirror_lake",
        "fac_ma_tribe",
        "fac_song_tribe",
        "char_cheng_hu",
        "char_fei_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Ma tribe fields rank five experts against Hei Lou Lan, he answers the first rank five challenge by sending Cheng Long, and he later commits Ma Zun, Jiang Bao Ya, and Yang Po Ying as three enslavement path masters to press Hei tribe’s army.",
      "chapters": [
        539
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ma-tribe-against-hei-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_cheng_long",
        "char_ma_zun",
        "char_jiang_bao_ya",
        "char_yang_po_ying",
        "fac_hei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After that charge falters, he forms a temporary defensive line, stakes snowman reinforcements with Xue Wa and other rank five snowmen, and offers five million battle merits plus Ma tribe supreme elder status to whoever kills Chang Shan Yin.",
      "chapters": [
        540
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ma-tribe-against-hei-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xue_wa",
        "char_chang_shan_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Ma Zun dies and Jiang Bao Ya deserts, he shouts for Rat King to return, then blacks out. When he wakes during the retreat he tries to hold a defense line, but Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s mountain as before Gu breaks it, and Pan Ping takes his head with sole blade Gu in the chaotic fight.",
      "chapters": [
        543
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-and-lineage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "gu_mountain_as_before_gu",
        "char_pan_ping",
        "gu_sole_blade_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later talk between Chang Biao and Pan Ping treats that kill as the death of Ma Ying Jie’s father.",
      "chapters": [
        576
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-and-lineage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chang_biao",
        "char_ma_ying_jie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The fan translation writes the name as Ma Shang Feng. No Chinese characters for the personal name appear in the English chapter text used here.",
